\f0\fs24 \cf0 # Stave Architecture Notes\
\
## Core Save Rule\
Tab objects in tabs[] are the ONLY source of truth.\
Never read from DOM on save. syncTabFromDOM() updates\
tab object on every keystroke. writeTabToDisk() writes\
from tab object only.\
\
## Tab Switching\
isSwitching flag blocks autosave during tab switch.\
Clear DOM before loading new tab to prevent bleed.\
\
## Plan vs Lock In Plan\
Same note file. Normal plan = compact view.\
Lock In plan = full screen with phases/timeline/links.\
Phases/links live in tab.phases and tab.links.\
They are NOT rendered in normal plan DOM.\
lockin-plan-closed IPC writes them back to tab object.\
\
## Note Types\
write \uc0\u8594  Stave/write/\
plan \uc0\u8594  Stave/plan/\
Both use same markdown format.\
Projects folder exists but unused \'97 plans replaced projects.\
\
## Mode Toggle\
write button shows amber write tabs only.\
plan button shows teal plan tabs only.\
newTabMode controls what + creates.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

