\fs36 \cf0 What is Stave\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 Stave is a minimal note-taking app for worship pastors, songwriters, and creative thinkers. It has two modes \'97 Write and Plan \'97 and two views per mode \'97 normal (compact) and Lock In (full screen).\
The Mac app saves notes as markdown files to iCloud Drive at 
\f3\fs26 ~/Library/Mobile Documents/com~apple~CloudDocs/Stave/
\f2\fs24 . The web app needs to read and write the same markdown format so notes are compatible across devices.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

