\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 Mac App Compatibility\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 The Mac app saves markdown files to iCloud Drive. The web app saves to Supabase. They are separate storage systems \'97 no automatic sync between them in Phase 1.\
In Phase 2, a bridge can sync: Mac app watches Stave iCloud folder, uploads changes to Supabase. Web app changes get written back to iCloud folder on next Mac app open.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

