## IPC Architecture\
renderer.js \uc0\u8594  main.js via ipcRenderer.send()\
main.js \uc0\u8594  renderer.js via win.webContents.send()\
main.js \uc0\u8594  lockin.html via lockInWin.webContents.send('init-lockin')\
main.js \uc0\u8594  lockin-plan.html via lockInPlanWin.webContents.send('init-lockin-plan')\
lockin-plan.html \uc0\u8594  main.js via ipcRenderer.send('close-lockin-plan', data)\
main.js \uc0\u8594  renderer.js via win.webContents.send('lockin-plan-closed', data)\
